              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amalaika me abiro te kuto apellere, eka dwonnogo aloŋo te winyere i polo ame kobo ni, “Loc me lobo doŋ oketo i ciŋ Rwotwa kede Kricito mere, en doŋ bino loc gire waŋ i waŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka odoŋe pyeraryo wie aŋwen ame obedo i kom locgi i nyim Obaŋa te onyere piny aryeba cuny, te woro Obaŋa ",
